@startuml
[*] --> SelectImage
SelectImage --> IdentifyDuplicates : User selects an image
IdentifyDuplicates --> TagDuplicates : System identifies duplicates
TagDuplicates --> UpdateTags : System tags duplicates
UpdateTags --> [*] : Tags updated, process completes
[*] --> ViewTags : User views all tags
ViewTags --> [*] : Return to initial state
[*] --> SearchImages : User searches by name/tag
SearchImages --> [*] : Search completes
IdentifyDuplicates --> [*] : No duplicates found
TagDuplicates --> [*] : Tagging completes
UpdateTags --> TagDuplicates : New tags applied
@enduml
